name: The Fool — copy last consumable
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Fool creates a copy of the last Tarot or Planet card used this run. First-shop
  copy engine: pair with a powerful Tarot/Planet generator (The Emperor, High Priestess,
  Cartomancer) so The Fool immediately copies something strong.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - tarotCard: TheFool
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheEmperor
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - tarotCard: TheHighPriestess
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Cartomancer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
